--- !u!114 &9168016203923038850
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1179504179237581628}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: fd9cd82e761c9db4bb9cc8d21780c8d5, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  title: Maria
  snippet: "Sweet girl, though her focus wanders. She spends most of her time talking
    about her dog or her weekend trips with her cousin. When she applies herself,
    she can produce surprisingly deep reflections, but most of the time she just
    rushes things. Probably juggling too much \u2014 part-time job, social life,
    etc. I think she\u2019s more tired than she lets on. - Review done by John"
  tags:
  - 'Information '
  metadataJson: "Barely shows up. When he does, he smells like smoke and sarcasm.
    I suspect there\u2019s stuff going on at home \u2014 he once mentioned sleeping
    on the couch \u201Cfor now.\u201D Fails most assignments but has occasional flashes
    of intelligence that make it frustrating. Doesn\u2019t like authority (especially
    me), but I think he\u2019s just angry at everything. Honestly I hate him. Really
    really hate him. - Done by John"
