  title: 'Jack Info '
  snippet: "Age: 16\n\nAddress: 14 Brookview Lane, Westbridge\n\nParent/Guardian:
    Eric Turner (older brother)\n\nNotes: Struggles with focus; attends school counseling
    twice a month. Plays video games late \u2014 reports 4\u20135 hours of sleep
    per night. Allergic to peanuts.\n\nPhone: 555-431-2198"
  tags:
  - 'Information '
  metadataJson: 
